.Op Fl t Ar target-pane
.Oo Ar shell-command Oo Ar argument Ar ... Oc Oc
.Xc
Start a new process in a pane whose program has exited (-k: kill the running
one first). The scrollback is kept.
.It Xo
.Ic respawn-window Pq Ic respawnw
